### Submit a rating (ratings-api)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pastryId": "STROOPWAFEL",
  "userId": "user-01",
  "score": 5,
  "flavors": ["CARAMEL", "BUTTERY"],
  "experience": "A perfect coffee companion with chewy caramel layers."
}

### Submit another quick rating for same pastry (used in debugging exercise)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pastryId": "STROOPWAFEL",
  "userId": "user-02",
  "score": 2,
  "flavors": ["SWEET"],
  "experience": "Too sweet for me today."
}

### Get flavor-based suggestions (matcher-api)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/suggestions?flavors=CARAMEL&flavors=BUTTERY&flavors=CRUNCHY
Accept: application/json
